    "Id": "chassisdef_wyvern_iic_WVE-IIC-2",
    "Name": "Wyvern",
    "Details": "A second line Clan mech, the 45 ton Wyvern IIC is an upgrade of the SLDF Wyverns that survived the Exodus. Built using a cache of Wyverns, Clan Burrock upgraded every aspect of the original mech with Clan tech. Retaining the original 180-rated Fusion Core, the Wyvern IIC-2 is armed with a mix of weapons. A Heavy Large Laser and an ATM-9 make up the Mechs long range firepower, with a pair of Heavy Medium Lasers for medium range combat. A trio of LMG’s, an ER Flamer and a pair of Heavy Smalls give additional firepower at close range.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Protected Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>",
